---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import ProjectPage from '../../components/ProjectPage.astro'
import ToonMaterial from '../../components/ToonMaterial.astro'
---

<Layout>
  <ProjectPage title="Playing with toon material">
    <ToonMaterial slot="project-code" />

    <Fragment slot="project-description">
      <p>
        As a gamer who loves JRPGs, adventure games and cell shading aesthetics,
        I was very curious about the toon material.
      </p>
      <p>
        I ended up a bit disappointed when trying to play with it using those
        basic meshes. It felt a bit limited to me, but I assumed it would show
        most of it strength with custom / complex models and textures. That's
        why I postponed its exploration until I would feel able to make my own
        models and textures ! :D
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  </ProjectPage>
</Layout>
